<diagram id="pb-mvp-proven-and-next-v0124" name="PB MVP Proven Lifecycle and Next Application Loop"><mxGraphModel dx="1900" dy="1320" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1320" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="l-title" value="&lt;b&gt;PB MVP lifecycle — proven environment release loop versus future application-development loop&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=24;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="25" width="1800" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l-sub" value="The green path is proven for Promptbranch itself. The grey path is the next product-level proof: use PB to build and release another application." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=14;fontColor=#374151;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="82" width="1720" height="35" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lane-env" value="&lt;b&gt;Lane 1 — Promptbranch environment lifecycle (proven)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111827;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="135" width="1820" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l1" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 1. Read accepted baseline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;pb artifact current&lt;br&gt;separate runtime/artifact/source roles" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="225" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l2" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 2. Structured release ask&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;request/correlation IDs&lt;br&gt;exact expected ZIP and reply envelope" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="225" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="le1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="l1" target="l2"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l3" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 3. Materialize candidate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;real downloadable ZIP&lt;br&gt;or reuse exact validated inbox bytes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="505" y="225" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="le2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="l2" target="l3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l4" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 4. Verify + migrate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SHA/size/VERSION/layout/hygiene&lt;br&gt;candidate registry, accepted unchanged" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="225" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="le3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="l3" target="l4"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l5" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 5. Candidate test&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;focused proof then full direct profile&lt;br&gt;record exact evidence" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="955" y="225" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="le4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="l4" target="l5"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l6" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 6. Explicit accept&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;test gate passes&lt;br&gt;local artifact/state adoption" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="225" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="le5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="l5" target="l6"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l7" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 7. Re-read current&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;artifact/source state and registry current&lt;br&gt;match candidate" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1405" y="225" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="le6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="l6" target="l7"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l8" value="&lt;b&gt;✓ 8. Lifecycle complete&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;candidate_mvp_complete&lt;br&gt;no actionable candidate remains" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="225" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="le7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="l7" target="l8"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="evidence-box" value="&lt;b&gt;v0.1.124 evidence checkpoint&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• focused pasted.txt source proof passed&lt;br&gt;• full direct candidate test passed&lt;br&gt;• accepted/current artifact v0.1.124&lt;br&gt;• runtime remains v0.1.123.2.6&lt;br&gt;• Project Source publication not performed&lt;br&gt;• optional localhost/external-live/run-all matrices not all proven" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="410" width="620" height="205" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="env-gaps" value="&lt;b&gt;Environment hardening still ahead&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. profile-sensitive full-test timeout&lt;br&gt;2. preserve/recover pending candidate ZIPs across clean installs&lt;br&gt;3. formal mandatory-vs-optional test matrix&lt;br&gt;4. decide and prove Project Source publication requirement&lt;br&gt;5. clean up stale top-level summary/reporting fields" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="410" width="1080" height="205" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="gate" value="&lt;b&gt;TRANSITION GATE — WE ARE HERE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The PB environment can produce, validate, and adopt its own release candidate. It has not yet demonstrated that it can safely drive the lifecycle of a separate application." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=18;fontColor=#111827;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="660" width="900" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="gate-in" value="environment MVP evidence" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff" edge="1" parent="1" source="l8" target="gate"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lane-app" value="&lt;b&gt;Lane 2 — First external application/tool lifecycle (next proof)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111827;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="815" width="1820" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="f1" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Select pilot app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;separate repo&lt;br&gt;small, observable vertical slice" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="55" y="905" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="f2" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Declare target + architecture&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PBAI/app boundaries&lt;br&gt;acceptance and non-goals" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="905" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lf1" value="future" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="f1" target="f2"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="f3" value="&lt;b&gt;3. PB plans one slice&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;inputs, files, tools, tests,&lt;br&gt;execution envelope" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="505" y="905" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lf2" value="future" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="f2" target="f3"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="f4" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Human-authorized change&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;controlled edits only&lt;br&gt;rollback snapshot" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="905" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lf3" value="future" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="f3" target="f4"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="f5" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Run application tests&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;not PB self-tests&lt;br&gt;unit/integration/acceptance" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="955" y="905" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lf4" value="future" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="f4" target="f5"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="f6" value="&lt;b&gt;6. Diagnose + correct&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;smallest evidence-driven repair&lt;br&gt;bounded retries" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="905" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lf5" value="future" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="f5" target="f6"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="f7" value="&lt;b&gt;7. Build app candidate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;application artifact&lt;br&gt;verify version/hygiene" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1405" y="905" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lf6" value="future" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="f6" target="f7"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="f8" value="&lt;b&gt;8. Accept/deploy app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;explicit app authority&lt;br&gt;post-release verification" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;dashed=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="905" width="205" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lf7" value="future" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="f7" target="f8"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="gate-out" value="next milestone" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=3;endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1" edge="1" parent="1" source="gate" target="f1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="0" height="0" relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="pilot-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Current documented pilot direction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Kubernetes game is described as the first future acceptance scenario and controlled test vehicle. It should remain outside PB’s own repository/runtime tests and become a separate application proof only after the environment MVP contract is frozen." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=16;fontColor=#111827;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="1120" width="1440" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="pb-env-exit-app-pilot-v0125" name="PB Environment Exit and Application Pilot Roadmap"><mxGraphModel dx="2000" dy="1320" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2000" pageHeight="1320" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="t" value="&lt;b&gt;Lifecycle transition: PB environment proof → external application pilot&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=24;fontColor=#1f2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1;resizable=0;movable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="25" width="1900" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="envlane" value="&lt;b&gt;PB environment lifecycle&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=20;fontColor=#111827;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="120" width="1920" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s124" value="v0.1.124&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;accepted checkpoint&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;candidate_mvp_complete" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=15;fontColor=#111827;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;shadow=0" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="225" width="320" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="s125" value="v0.1.125&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;repe